  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Internationella Jursistkommissionens (ICJ) program &quot;African Human Rights and Acess to Justice Programme&quot; (AHRAJ) genom ICJ-Sverige och ICJ-Kenya. M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen f&#xf6;r programmet har varit att nationalisera internationella standards till processande i nationella domstolar eller Afrikanska Kommissionen f&#xf6;r M&#xe4;nskliga R&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the International Commission of Jurists (ICJ) program &quot;African Human Rights and Acess to Justice Programme&quot; (AHRAJ) through ICJ-Sweden and ICJ-Kenya. The main objective of AHRAJ have been to nationalize international standards for the processing in national courts or the African Commission on Human and Peoples&apos; Rights.</narrative>
  </description>
